On September 3, 2026, Oregon State Police produced its file on me under pub=
lic records request PR27478. In it is your email of March 27, 2026, 11:04 A=
M, to Deputy Evan Meyers of the Lane County Sheriff's Office, copied to Det=
ectives Hyde and Nelson. You sent
 it hours after you terminated my call that morning, the call in which I as=
ked the three officers who came to my home to identify themselves. You refu=
sed to give me the OSP officers' information. Your email gave a fourth agen=
cy all of mine: my name, my date
 of birth, my driver's license number, my residence, my schedule, my duties=
, my correspondence, and my text messages.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
The email contains false statements about me. I am correcting each of them,=
 in writing, to every person who received them.</div>
<ol start=3D"1" style=3D"direction: ltr;">
<li style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Apto=
s_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; col=
or: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You wrote that I was &quot;fired due to his negative interactions with the =
public while performing his duties. Notably enforcing rules in an unprofess=
ional manner.&quot; That is false. The Department's dismissal letter of Mar=
ch 26, 2025, which the police file you were
 working from itself contains, states the basis: &quot;the disparaging publ=
ic comments made about staff regarding your volunteer service.&quot; My pub=
lic speech. Not my interactions with the public, and not the enforcement of=
 any rule. Your email also states I volunteered
 &quot;up until the summer of 2025.&quot; My service ended March 24, 2025. =
If you hold any record supporting your characterization, produce it. If you=
 do not, correct it with Deputy Meyers the same way you circulated it to hi=
m.</li><li style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &qu=
ot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12=
pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You wrote that I &quot;stated he felt intimidated.&quot; I did not describe=
 a feeling. I stated that the visit was intimidation. The distinction matte=
rs, and I am restoring it.</li><li style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos=
_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, s=
ans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You wrote that you told me &quot;there is no restriction on Officers to tha=
t area.&quot; What happened on that call is that I informed you the Siltcoo=
s Work Center is a restricted access area, a locked federal facility behind=
 a locked gate, and you disputed it. Your
 own email now records that dispute in writing.</li><li style=3D"font-famil=
y: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, =
Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Your email attributes OSP's interest to &quot;multiple veil threats&quot; a=
nd states, in the same bullet, &quot;No crimes committed.&quot; No statemen=
t of mine claimed to be a veiled threat has ever been identified, quoted, o=
r produced by any agency. Detective Hyde, after reviewing
 my website, wrote that nothing stood out beyond a grievance with a former =
employer. Detective Nelson's report concludes I made no direct threats, sho=
wed no leakage toward violence, and committed no crimes. On September 3, 20=
26, I asked Oregon State Police
 in writing to produce the statement or state that none exists.</li></ol>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
Deputy Meyers: you received the characterizations above; you now hold the c=
orrections, and the documents behind them are published in full at oprdvolu=
nteerabuse.org. Your office is now a custodian of records in this matter. P=
lease preserve your copy of the
 March 27 email, its attachments, and this letter.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
Special Agent Oliver: your email told Deputy Meyers you would &quot;keep yo=
u up to date.&quot; Every update you have sent him or anyone else concernin=
g me is a federal record, and I ask that it be preserved. If you dispute an=
y statement in this letter, do so in writing.
 If you do not, the record will treat your account as corrected.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
